---

Assess complexity for feature {{.id}}: "{{.title}}" using assessment skill (complexity-triage workflow).

LOAD: assessment skill - Use Workflow 1: Complexity Triage.

READ:
(1) Feature description at {{.file_path}}
(2) Parent epic PRD for context
(3) Codebase via research skill for file impact estimation
(4) Existing tasks via shark task list --feature={{.id}} for task count

SCORE: Use 9-dimension scoring from assessment skill (max 27 points) - Technical Complexity (6 dimensions: File Impact, Pattern Novelty, Data Model, API Surface, Cross-Feature Dependencies, UI Complexity) + Execution Complexity (3 dimensions: Task Estimation, Regression Risk, Execution Effort).

TIER ASSIGNMENT: 0-6=SIMPLE, 7-15=STANDARD, 16+=COMPLEX per assessment skill tier thresholds.

PRODUCE: Triage report following assessment skill template with dimension scores, total score, tier assignment, file impact estimate, autonomous build feasibility.

STORE METADATA: shark feature note {{.id}} 'COMPLEXITY_TIER: {tier} (score: {score}/27) - {rationale}' --metadata complexity_tier={tier} complexity_score={score}.

ROUTE: SIMPLE->ready_for_task_generation, STANDARD->ready_for_refinement_ba, COMPLEX->ready_for_research. Execute routing via shark feature update {{.id}} --status={target_status}.
